From: patrickjquinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:48:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 278/286] arm64: configs: mt6858: Add the IMX616 and IMX766
 sensors

Build the drivers of the JP2601's front (IMX616) and main rear (IMX766)
cameras as modules.
---
 arch/arm64/configs/mt6858.config | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/mt6858.config b/arch/arm64/configs/mt6858.config
index 55ffcb600..60fd8bf76 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/mt6858.config
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/mt6858.config
@@ -115,3 +115,5 @@ CONFIG_COMMON_CLK_MT6858_CAMSYS=m
 CONFIG_REGULATOR_DIO8018=m
 CONFIG_VIDEO_IMX214=m
 CONFIG_TYPEC_TCPCI_MT6720=m
+CONFIG_VIDEO_IMX616=m
+CONFIG_VIDEO_IMX766=m
-- 
2.55.0

